35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people use it eleven times, others four. Invoices show 68k yen paid.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The last awkward talk was in front of everyone. Unplanned talk is now only by the printer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Lunch takes 25 minutes. Facilities had 11 callouts for equipment rooms, none for the empty store.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Quotes are 141k for meeting space, 96k for kitchen. Invoices confirm 68k spent on outside hire.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is thin plasterboard. You can hear everything. Crumbs are under three keyboards.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
