44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, a quiet room might help, but the wall is the problem.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The data suggests we are paying for space we don't use well.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
