47,2,3,talk,May,,"If we eat in the room, we save 25 minutes a day.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The kitchen option is cheaper and solves the lunch problem.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The meeting space is expensive and the wall is too thin for privacy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards the kitchen. It saves money and time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I prefer the meeting space for conversations, but the cost is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
